<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. An Eyebrow, Heading or Subheading block of the products-b
  sections (Products Listing, Products carousel). live-products-b.js derives
  the same --pb-* values in the builder.
  block: the block. json: its settings as JSON (pb_bjson). cls: extra class.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign bs = block.settings -%}
{%- capture pb_style -%}
  {%- if block.type == 'heading' -%}
    {%- if bs.enable_custom_style -%}--pb-c: {% render 'scheme-color', color: bs.color, fallback: 'var(--color-heading)' %};{%- endif -%}
    --pb-fs-d: {{ bs.size_desktop | default: 36 }}px;--pb-fs-m: {{ bs.size_mobile | default: 28 }}px;
  {%- else -%}
    {%- if bs.enable_custom_style -%}--pb-c: {% render 'scheme-color', color: bs.color, fallback: 'var(--color-text)' %};{%- endif -%}
    --pb-fs: {{ bs.size | default: 16 }}px;
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture pb_attrs -%}data-pb-block="{{ block.id }}" data-pb-type="{{ block.type }}" data-pb-settings="{{ json | escape }}" style="{{ pb_style | strip }}"{% if bs.text == blank %} hidden{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- case block.type -%}
  {%- when 'eyebrow' -%}
    <p class="pb-eyebrow {{ cls }}" {{ pb_attrs }}>{{ bs.text | escape }}</p>
  {%- when 'heading' -%}
    <h2 class="pb-heading heading-letter-spacing {{ cls }}" {{ pb_attrs }}>{{ bs.text }}</h2>
  {%- when 'subheading' -%}
    <div class="pb-sub rich__text-m0 {{ cls }}" {{ pb_attrs }}>{{ bs.text }}</div>
{%- endcase -%}
</template>
